{"RunId":"5528b6ba-281b-4a30-aa58-606af6355353","Seq":28,"Kind":"NodeCompleted","Synthetic":true,"TimestampUtc":"2026-04-24T23:53:22.2597475Z","NodeId":"n_ym05bcg","NodeName":null,"Payload":{"nodeInstanceId":"beec0d9f-a696-4255-b84c-6c4dc7a47476","duration":"PT1M39.5877418S","inputData":{"triggerType":"WebHook","triggerTime":"2026-04-24T23:51:42.6368236Z","webHookMethod":"POST","webHookRoute":"/webhook/investigate-icm","bodyJsonSchema":"{\n   \u0022type\u0022: \u0022object\u0022,\n   \u0022required\u0022: [\u0022incidentId\u0022, \u0022serviceName\u0022, \u0022teamName\u0022, \u0022timestamp\u0022],\n   \u0022properties\u0022: {\n     \u0022incidentId\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022integer\u0022, \u0022format\u0022: \u0022int64\u0022 },\n     \u0022serviceName\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022string\u0022 },\n     \u0022teamName\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022string\u0022 },\n     \u0022timestamp\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022string\u0022, \u0022format\u0022: \u0022date-time\u0022 }\n   }\n }","messageType":"json","body.timestamp":"2026-04-24T23:51:26.134Z","body.incidentId":783872773,"body.serviceName":"","body.teamName":"","__webhookBody":"{\n  \u0022incidentId\u0022: 783872773 ,\n  \u0022serviceName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022teamName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022timestamp\u0022: \u00222026-04-24T23:51:26.134Z\u0022\n}"},"outputData":{"mode":"skill","backend":"copilot","model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","agentName":"open-icm","agentSummary":"","result":"Here\u0027s a summary of ICM **783872773**:\n\n---\n\n## \uD83D\uDCCB Incident Summary\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Service** | Azure Stack HCI |\n| **Team** | Arc Managed VMs |\n| **Owner** | Michael Duppr\u00E9 (mduppre) |\n| **Severity** | Sev 3 |\n| **Status** | Active |\n| **Region** | USGOVVirginia |\n\n**Title:** Cannot delete orphaned network interface; also wants to recreate LNET\n\n---\n\n## \uD83D\uDD0D Root Cause\n\nThis is a **webhook validation bug triggered on a DELETE operation**:\n\n1. Customer deployed AzureLocal cluster \u0060ceo-clu001\u0060 on **build 2512** and created \u0060LNET1-Static\u0060 (IP range includes \u006010.10.35.52\u0060\u2013\u006010.10.35.61\u0060)\n2. After upgrading to **build 2601**, the upgrade automatically created a new infra LNET (\u0060ceo-clu001-Infra-LNET\u0060) with **overlapping IP ranges** \u2014 conflicting with the pre-existing \u0060LNET1-Static\u0060\n3. Customer deleted VM \u0060arcvm001\u0060, leaving behind orphaned NIC \u0060arcvm001-NIC\u0060\n4. Attempting to delete the orphaned NIC triggers \u0060createupdatevalidationwebhook.infrastructure.azstackhci.microsoft.com\u0060, which **incorrectly runs IP pool conflict validation on a DELETE operation**, blocking cleanup:\n\n   \u003E *\u0022The following IP Pool ranges you entered are already in use: [10.10.35.52, 10.10.35.61] by ceo-clu001-InfraLNET\u0022*\n\nThe core bug: **the admission webhook fires IP range conflict checks during NIC deletion**, which is logically incorrect \u2014 IP pool validation should only apply to CREATE/UPDATE operations.\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 Recommended Next Steps\n\n1. **Immediate (unblock customer):** Help the customer delete the orphaned NIC via ARM API directly, bypassing the portal webhook flow, or use \u0060kubectl delete\u0060 on the underlying MOC/Arc resource on the cluster.\n\n2. **Root cause fix:** Investigate the \u0060createupdatevalidationwebhook\u0060 handler \u2014 add a guard to skip IP pool range conflict validation when the operation is \u0060DELETE\u0060.\n\n3. **LNET overlap cleanup:** Once the NIC is deleted, assist the customer in resolving the LNET IP range overlap between \u0060LNET1-Static\u0060 and \u0060ceo-clu001-Infra-LNET\u0060. This likely requires either adjusting one LNET\u0027s IP range or removing the infra LNET created during the 2601 upgrade.\n\n4. **Log access note:** Stamp is in USGOVVirginia \u2014 direct log access is unavailable; may require customer to pull and share logs.\n\n5. **Low urgency:** This is an internal test stamp with no customer production impact (Sev 3).","ai.success":true,"ai.model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","ai.durationMs":83950,"ai.inputTokens":248849,"ai.outputTokens":2440},"globalVariables":{"maxQueryScore":0,"body.timestamp":"2026-04-24T23:51:26.134Z","codeIssueFile":"","__webhookBody":"{\n  \u0022incidentId\u0022: 783872773 ,\n  \u0022serviceName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022teamName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022timestamp\u0022: \u00222026-04-24T23:51:26.134Z\u0022\n}","repoMdFile":"E:\\work\\hub\\docs\\wiki\\repos.md","body.incidentId":783872773,"rcaFile":"","metadataFile":"","body.serviceName":"","discussionFile":"","mitigationStepsFile":"","body.teamName":"","rootRepoFolder":"E:\\work","incidentId":0,"queryLoopCount":0,"applicableTsgFile":"","incidentFolder":"","etwEventsFile":"","summaryFile.md":"","issueListFile":""}}}
